				<p>
					<lb n="1"/><hi rend="grantha">śubhamastu</hi> <g ref="sym:doubleBar" type="punctuation">.</g> <hi rend="grantha">svasti</hi> <supplied reason="subaudible"><g ref="sym:doubleBar" type="punctuation">.</g></supplied> <hi rend="grantha">śrīmaNmahārājādhirāja rājaparameśvara śrī</hi>vī<hi rend="grantha">rapra</hi>tā<hi rend="grantha">pa śrī</hi> vī<hi rend="grantha">rakṛṣṇa</hi>ya<hi rend="grantha">de</hi>va<hi rend="grantha">mahārā</hi>yaṟkuc cellum <hi rend="grantha">śakābdaM</hi> <num value="1432"><g type="numeral">1000</g> 4 <g type="numeral">100</g> 3 <g type="numeral">10</g> 2</num><g ref="sym:dash" type="punctuation"/>ṉmel cellāniṉṟa <hi rend="grantha">pramodū</hi>ta<hi rend="grantha">saṁ</hi>va<hi rend="grantha">Tsara</hi>ttu <hi rend="grantha">karkka</hi>ṭa<hi rend="grantha">ka</hi><unclear>nāyaṟṟu</unclear> pū<hi rend="grantha">rvvapakṣa</hi>ttu <hi rend="grantha">deśa</hi>miyum <gap reason="lost" quantity="10" unit="character"/> 
					
					<lb n="2"/>kāḷattiĀṉa mummuṭicoḻapurattu nāyanār tirukkāḷattiUṭaiya nāyanār koyil <hi rend="grantha">śrī</hi>paṇṭārakkaṇkāṇi ceyvārkaḷom velañceṟuUṭaiyār tukkaṇa<unclear>r</unclear> piccappiḷḷaikku <hi rend="grantha">dharmmaśāsa</hi>nam paṇṇikkuṭuttappaṭi <supplied reason="subaudible"><g ref="sym:bar" type="punctuation">.</g></supplied> tām Iraṇṭām piṟa <gap reason="lost" quantity="2" unit="character"/> 
					
					<lb n="3"/>ṇāmuttinayiṉār Amutuceytaruḷumpaṭikku nāyanār tevatāṉamāṉa ciṭṭattūril manti<unclear>rikuḷat</unclear>tukku Iṭṭa <g ref="sym:tam-panam"/> <num value="800">8 <g type="numeral">100</g></num> Inta paṇam Eṇṇūṟṟukkum ciṟukuḻi veṭṭuvittu nilamum tirutti Inta Erikiḻil piṟanta mutal koṇṭu Iṉnayinār Amutuceytaruḷa nāḷ Oṉṟukku ciṟukālaicantiyi<seg type="aksara"><seg type="component" subtype="body"><gap reason="lost" quantity="1" unit="component"/></seg>e</seg> <gap reason="lost" quantity="9" unit="character"/> 
					
					<lb n="4"/>Āḻākkum kaṟiAmutu tayiramutum cāttiaruḷat tirumālai Oraṇaiyum caṉṉatiyil pakal Iṭum tiruviḷakku Oṉṟum Irā<hi rend="grantha">tri</hi><surplus>ri</surplus> Iṭum tiruviḷakku nālum nāḷ<unclear>to</unclear>ṟum tappāmal <hi rend="grantha">candrāditya</hi>varai naṭattakkaṭavomākavum <hi rend="grantha">dharmmakarttā</hi><unclear>vu</unclear>kku nālattoṉṟukku varum <hi rend="grantha">prasā</hi>tam nāḻiyum tammiṭa <hi rend="grantha">sa</hi>  <gap reason="lost" quantity="9" unit="character"/> 
					
					<lb n="5"/>mpalattu kaiyilāyamuṭaiyārum Ivar vaṟkattārum naṭattakkaṭavarkaḷāka nicceyittukkuṭutteṉ paṉaippa <gap reason="lost" quantity="3" unit="character"/> ttil maruttuvaṉ tūḷiĀḻvāṉ periyaUṭaiyāṉeṉ <supplied reason="subaudible"><g ref="sym:bar" type="punctuation">.</g></supplied> Itu <hi rend="grantha">śrīmāheśva<unclear>ra</unclear> rakṣai</hi> <g ref="sym:doubleBar" type="punctuation">.</g><g ref="sym:dash-long" type="punctuation">.</g> Inta naṉtavaṉattu Ūrviṉivokattukku Āṇṭu Oṉṟukku Ivvūr Ūravaṟku Iraṇṭu paṇam <gap reason="lost" quantity="5" unit="character"/> 
				</p>
				
